                    subtitle:               `A viral greenwashing post just hit Vista days before the autumn launch. Warmth is strong at 72, but competence sits at 58 and morality has slid to 49 — and purchase intent has fallen from 62% to 55%. Allocate €14M of marketing spend across sustainability substance and communication to move the right impression, defend the 18% premium, and show the CFO a defensible ROMI.`,
