                    coach_intro:            `The watchdog post is spreading: “premium prices, vague green claims.” Vista is liked — warmth 72 — but morality has fallen to 49 and intent to 55%. Your real sustainability work was never turned into a credible signal. Žabkar’s research is the lens: sustainability investments move specific impressions — warmth, competence, morality — and those drive purchase intent. Connect each euro to the impression it buys, and make sure the substance is real before you amplify it. The CFO is watching the ROMI.`,

