                    constraint_morality:    `Morality — integrity is under attack at 49 and down 9 pts; that is the dimension blocking intent`,
                    constraint_competence:  `Competence — prove the product quality and capability first`,
                    constraint_warmth:      `Warmth — keep people loving the brand; likeability is what sells`,
                    constraint_none:        `No single constraint — lift all three impressions equally`,
