                    r3_comms_label:         `Communication spend — channels & campaign (€M of the €14M).`,
                    r3_comms_readout:       `Communication:`,
                    r3_budget_hint:         `Substance + communication cannot exceed €14M. Unspent budget is held in reserve, but over-spending on reach the CFO can’t tie to margin sinks your ROMI.`,
                    r3_sequence_label:      `Sequencing — when does the campaign run relative to the proof?`,
                    sequence_proExpress:    `Amplify only once the audit/certification lands — proof before the message`,
                    sequence_loudfirst:     `Launch loud in week one — get ahead of the news cycle; certification finishes in month four`,
